The  driver  provides  support  for voltage, temperature, and fan
sensors available as an device on motherboards.   The  number  of
sensors  of each type, as well as the description of each sensor,
varies according to the motherboard.  The driver supports an  ar‐
bitrary set of sensors, provides descriptions regarding what each
sensor is used for, and reports whether each sensor is within the
specifications as defined by the motherboard manufacturer through
